<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.AFRICA MONEY MKT SHORTAGE AT 9.602 BLN RAND MON.</title>
<headline>S.AFRICA MONEY MKT SHORTAGE AT 9.602 BLN RAND MON.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The South African Reserve Bank said the money market shortage rose to 9.602 billion rand on Monday from 8.834 billion rand on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
